type CheckoutSessionActionKind string

// CheckoutSessionActionMode `setup` when nothing is charged now and the session only saves the card under `mandate` (a subscription whose first period is free): show no total and a "save card" action. Absent means `payment`.
type CheckoutSessionActionMode string

